<title>UK: FKI notes Newman Tonks interest sale.</title>
<headline>FKI notes Newman Tonks interest sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FKI Plc, the engineering group, said on Friday it had noted the announcement from Newman Tonks, its takeover target, on plans to sell its one-third interest in a Spanish joint venture TESA to Williams Holdings.</p>
<p>FKI has also posted the details of its 195.7 million stg hostile takeover offer for Newman Tonks Plc and said that acceptances should be received by 1500 GMT on January 10.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
